{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-menthol-lemon-cucumber","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Menthol Lemon Cucumber","description":"\u003cp\u003eLemon \u0026amp; Cucumber Menthol nic salt by Riot Squad is a fruit blend featuring cooling yet sharp notes. A zesty lemon and subtle cucumber combine on inhale, topped off by a crisp menthol endnote for a layered flavour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeaturing a 50% VG concentration, this nic salt will produce a discreet amount of vapour for an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale. It pairs best with a refillable kit that's designed for MTL vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41990940065847,"sku":"Riot - Menthol Lemon Cucumber 20 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41990940098615,"sku":"Riot - Menthol Lemon Cucumber 48 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/riot-squad-hybrid-menthol-lemon-cucumber-nic-salt.webp?v=1763425358","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/riot-squad-salts-menthol-lemon-cucumber","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




